  "description": "Seek Your Summit\n\nLighter than your water bottle.\n\nUltraLight Carbon Frame Weighing from sub 700g, each gram is meticulously accounted for to ensure exceptional strength-to-weight ratio for effortless climbs and nimble handling. Expect PRs.\n\nAmple tire clearance allows for versatile riding options\n\nAmple tire clearance allows for versatile riding options. From buttery roads to rough tarmac and even some unpaved routes, Suncrest is at home on the roads no matter where they go.\n\nNo Manufacturing Gimmicks Here.\n\nUsing industry standard parts on axles, seat clamps, seat posts, and headsets keeps servicing your Suncrest simple and quick. Even with these easy to source parts we were able to achieve a frame weight that’s sub 700g.\n\nI want fast and comfortable. Is that possible?\n\nYes and Yes. The Suncrest offers a fit for maximum aerodynamics and power transfer, catering to riders who prioritize performance and efficiency, while still being comfortable and a joy to ride each and every time you go out.",
